#X text 20 20 The drum screen's logic. GENERATED by build-remote.py -- edit that \, not this. The mode puts the ViewPort over the drum screen in mode 1 and over the remote screen otherwise \, once per change: u_net repeats it twice a second., f 70;
#X obj 20 160 r dr-mode-in;
