#X text 600 20 The state: playing \, the global last step \, the selected track \, a pending sync or snap \, then each track's last step and whether it is its own \, then the time signature \, the drunkenness and the selected track's skip and move. list split 41 drops anything short \, as the empty repeat before the first state. t b a a: the arrays first \, then the header \, which gives expr the track \, then the sixteen cells., f 60;
