#X obj 1300 360 unpack f f f f f;
#X text 1700 20 The time signature's numbers: the label \, and its x for one digit or two. A slider takes the state with set \, so it sends nothing back \, and sets the change its touches go through \, so a touch to the value it had still sends. A touch shuts the spigot for a second: the state coming back meanwhile is the old value \, and would pull the slider back from under the finger., f 60;
